  "body_html": "<p>“Tim…you said <em><strong>Blow Off Top</strong></em>…but now you are talking about a <em><strong>Bull Trap</strong></em>?!” </p><p>To be fair…a blow off top is essentially a massive bull trap. Information has changed over the last few days with oil prices presenting an ominous signal. If you didn’t see my latest post about <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-113459534\">oil price action being a leading indicator, you can watch it here.</a> Additionally, <em><strong>this post is more for those who want to actively trade the markets</strong></em> and are well versed in the utilization of stops. Long term investing, in my opinion, remains to be a bad choice; you can read more on that <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/long-term-investment?r=4z8lgl\">here</a>.</p><p>Now, I will be trading <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$QQQ&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SQQQ&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> predominantly. This same strategy can be applied for <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> .  </p><p> <strong>If you are interested in the strategy, here are the details 👇</strong></p><p>Lets address the elephant in the room first: Blow off top or bull trap? I wish it were that simple predicting the future…but it is not. My short answer is: it could be both. </p><p>We have not cancelled the blow off top….simply following price action trends. This has kept us out of hot water and even returned a few profits. But we have volatility contraction patterns (VCP) developing. This is higher lows and a relatively flat price ceiling. Do be aware,   VCP’s have higher probabilities of working in a trending bull market…which we are technically in a bear market right now. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png\" width=\"1360\" height=\"745\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:745,&quot;width&quot;:1360,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:132029,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/162609199?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rXSV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F12b197a9-2c9c-4a9b-837f-1cb5f2fcdc73_1360x745.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Flat price action ceiling, higher lows forming, a VCP formation. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Now, lets start off with what we KNOW…and bear with me as I am going to walk the dog on this one a bit. We know that the market can ONLY do 1 of 3 things…go up, go down, or go sideways. “DUH TIM!”. As a breakout trader myself, we are seeking a breakout from the consolidation (the VCP), labeled in white. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png\" width=\"1367\" height=\"736\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:736,&quot;width&quot;:1367,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:159151,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/162609199?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MCxV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F433869a0-26da-4924-a7c7-d02cc626a1f2_1367x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">We can only go 3 directions here….DUH!</figcaption></figure></div><p> The breakout from the consolidation will, in the near future, present a big red candle, or a big green candle. Remember, we are not trying to get “perfect prices”….we are trying to <em><strong>capture a PIECE of a trend. </strong></em>Do not try to get perfect tops or bottoms…you will almost always fail. So what does a “big red” or “big green” candle look like? It will be a definitive statement in price action saying, that at least short term…price action is going to go one direction. Typically it will look something like the below <strong>👇</strong>:</p>",
